    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65238" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάτημι</span></b>  (A), 
			Aeol.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ματεύω</span>
			, in 2sg.
			pres.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάτης, ἐξ ἑτέρω ἕτερον μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					29.15
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				Ion.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ματεῖσθαι,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζητεῖσθαι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ματεῖ: ζητεῖ</span>.)</div>
